From: Akhil Marri <akhilm28@stanford.edu>
Date: Mon, 5 Oct 2026 22:10:15 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 01/12] Build with XC16 2.10; power-averaged P&O, PI integrator
 remainder, goal clamps, hold mode; compact CAN service

- periph_compat.c replaces the COFF-only legacy peripheral library
- drop protobuf state stream (pb_encode) to fit program memory
- photon_service: table-driven registers, live-writable TUNE block, debug stream on base+0xE1/0xE2
